OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GBarbara Hannigan conducts the
OL,6,     GLausanne Chamber Orchestra, and
OL,7,     Gpianist Bertrand Chamayou joins
OL,8,     Gfor Henry Cowell's Irish Suite.
OL,9,G0630FBreakfast
OL,10,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,11,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,12,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,13,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,14,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,15,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,16,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,17,     Gwith familiar favourites.
